{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42799","headline":"再看光福寺牡丹 · 刘兼","name":"再看光福寺牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年曾看牡丹花，蛱蝶迎人傍彩霞。\n今日再游光福寺，春风吹我入仙家。\n当筵芬馥歌唇动，倚槛娇羞醉眼斜。\n来岁未朝金阙去，依前和露载归衙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}